<title>DUBAI: Sharjah air volumes up yr/yr 23.9 pct in November.</title>
<headline>Sharjah air volumes up yr/yr 23.9 pct in November.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sharjah airport said cargo volumes rose a year-on-year 23.93 percent in November to 32,119 tonnes from 25,916 tonnes in the same month in 1995.</p>
<p>This compared to the 30,261 tonnes handled in September 1996.</p>
<p>Sea-air freight exports rose 25.90 percent in the month to 2,530 tonnes from 2,009 tonnes the previous November. -- Dubai newsroom, +9714-626990</p>
